('rifle-musket/fs675623_craigsmith_musket-volley.mp3', 'musket volley, vintage optical film effect', 'https://freesound.org/people/craigsmith/sounds/675623/', 'craigsmith', CC0, 'S21-03 Musket volley.wav by craigsmith (Freesound 675623), CC0', 'tags 35mm-Mag, Optical, Vintage, ANTIQUE: digitised from a vintage film sound-effects library; noise floor about -28 dBFS', 'not sliced (dense volley, 0 shots detected); reference for volley density', 'low quality, noisy, and film foley possible'),
