('signals/ia_TapsBugleCall_taps.ogg', 'Taps on bugle (US Army Bands Online)', 'https://archive.org/details/TapsBugleCall', 'U.S. Army Bands', ('Public domain (Internet Archive licence URL: creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain)', 'https://creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain/'), 'U.S. Army Bands Online (public domain)', 'Internet Archive item: Ogg Vorbis 44.1 kHz stereo ~112 kbps', 'signal reference', 'Taps (Butterfield, July 1862) existed at Gettysburg only as a new call; performance is modern'),
